Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}The Aqua Pearl
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 29
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.38,0:12:16.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.52,0:00:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,No response.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.35,0:00:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I must protect the Aqua Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.03,0:00:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I won’t let anyone touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.68,0:00:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei, what’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.19,0:00:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.11,0:00:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.04,0:00:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I was wondering when Dr. Mei had acquired a daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.03,0:01:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,…and she was so determined to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.07,0:01:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you are the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.19,0:01:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let her go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t do anything rash.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.38,0:01:12.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Otherwise, I can’t guarantee what might happen to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.43,0:01:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,How despicable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.37,0:01:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I possess it,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.81,0:01:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll have an endless supply of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.51,0:01:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, you take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.75,0:01:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.38,0:01:46.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.62,0:01:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My hand…it feels so heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.69,0:02:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll go get the Aqua Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.14,0:02:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.85,0:02:27.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No one is going to take the Aqua Pearl from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.38,0:02:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s so heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.73,0:02:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,The Aqua Pearl is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.10,0:03:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can’t I see Guangzong anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.81,0:03:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Guangzong and the others must have slipped into the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.01,0:03:10.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust Weslie and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.54,0:03:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I can’t hold on much longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.10,0:03:21.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.38,0:03:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll blast a path through here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.94,0:03:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, your shells are too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.25,0:03:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,If an explosion happens here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.85,0:03:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,we’ll be the ones who get hurt first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.57,0:03:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:03:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,ID 0420.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.96,0:03:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I have transformed you into a robot that guards the Aqua Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.19,0:04:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, your mission is to guard the Aqua Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.88,0:04:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I…I am a robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.35,0:04:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.79,0:04:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei, you aren’t a robot at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.84,0:04:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.67,0:04:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.35,0:04:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,are simply yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.43,0:04:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I am…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.79,0:04:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.55,0:04:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,you must live for yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.67,0:04:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, you have only one mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:43.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.35,0:04:45.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the Aqua Pearl well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.27,0:04:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No one but me is allowed to touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the Aqua Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.87,0:04:54.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:04:58.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.75,0:05:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,How did it suddenly become so powerful?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.84,0:05:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.40,0:05:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,My Aqua Pearl…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.00,0:06:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Aqua…Pearl
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.89,0:06:05.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.61,0:06:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the Aqua Pearl
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.40,0:06:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wake up
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.32,0:06:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Protect the Aqua Pearl
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.16,0:06:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.25,0:06:19.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.80,0:06:22.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We can’t let them get the Aqua Pearl!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.00,0:06:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, get it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But you got hurt because of the Aqua Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.60,0:06:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it worth it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.60,0:06:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We’ve come this far
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.71,0:06:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m taking this
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.79,0:06:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,all just for the sake of your better lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.39,0:06:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,But now…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.16,0:06:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m completely out of options.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.51,0:06:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How about I get that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.79,0:06:48.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.11,0:06:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.23,0:06:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Here’s the plan:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you grab it, I’ll pull you out with a stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.74,0:06:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I’m going to get the Aqua Pearl now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.62,0:07:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.23,0:07:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m going to get this Aqua Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you won’t let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.87,0:07:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.97,0:07:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m here to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.23,0:07:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Take anything of value.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.76,0:07:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.07,0:07:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.79,0:08:01.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t leave me behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.71,0:08:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.61,0:08:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone, save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.04,0:08:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.68,0:08:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Check out these gauntlets I just upgraded with those machine parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Jay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:28.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can’t I get in touch with anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.31,0:08:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has lost contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.95,0:08:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that they…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.95,0:08:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,ran into danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.22,0:08:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.86,0:08:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Slowy, we’re back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.87,0:08:51.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m glad you’re back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.83,0:08:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, did you get the fragments?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.67,0:08:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We ran into a few surprises,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.02,0:08:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,but we got the fragments.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.36,0:09:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to study these fragments carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.27,0:09:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t speak. I’ll bandage that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.91,0:09:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,To think that the two of us, usually so sharp,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.90,0:09:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,actually got tricked by you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.66,0:09:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A villain as wicked as you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.68,0:09:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,must be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.96,0:09:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You only got tricked because you were naïve.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.00,0:09:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The ones with the problem
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.53,0:09:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.32,0:09:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:09:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I will protect Aqua Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.08,0:10:15.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.45,0:10:19.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You heinous villain
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.97,0:10:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Surrender immediately
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.16,0:10:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You are Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.95,0:10:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I am 0420
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.75,0:10:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You are definitely not a robot
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the time we spent together?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.40,0:10:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The desert flower you picked for me
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.32,0:10:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,When you had a fever and leaned on my arm
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.88,0:10:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,When you leaned on me out of fear
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.31,0:10:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The final moment we shared with Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.83,0:11:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.95,0:11:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao Mei
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.02,0:11:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry for the trouble I’ve caused you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.26,0:11:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It’s a relief that you’re okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.18,0:11:25.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about hurting them again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.14,0:11:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ve been wondering…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.54,0:11:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If the two fragments were fused together,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.46,0:11:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,just how much power would that generate?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.56,0:12:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This fragment holds so much energy;
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.14,0:12:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,it absolutely must not fall into the wrong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.61,0:12:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
